{"synopsis":"Kombinasi paling orisinal dalam sejarah—darah manusia dan ogre bersatu!” ‘Leon’ blasteran, lahir dari perpaduan manusia dan ogre. Namun, yang kembali padanya sebagai blasteran hanyalah eksploitasi dan pengkhianatan manusia. Leon membenci manusia seperti itu dan bersumpah untuk membalas dendam. Bagi Leon, yang selalu menderita karena kekurangan kekuatan, keberuntungan datang memanggil, dan ia diberi kesempatan untuk membalas dendam pada manusia.","alternative_title":"하프 블러드","author":"Bangyo, Kim Jeong-Ryul","artist":"Studio A.H.A","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"38ba5f3a-4461-4e3b-9b05-21f1a3504fa6","number":"54","chapter":"54","title":"","date":"2026-07-17","released":"2026-07-17","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f75ffbb5-523b-4af9-8ed9-8b68f0a9e321/chapter_ch_54/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f75ffbb5-523b-4af9-8ed9-8b68f0a9e321/chapter_ch_54/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f75ffbb5-523b-4af9-8ed9-8b68f0a9e321/chapter_ch_54/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f75ffbb5-523b-4af9-8ed9-8b68f0a9e321/chapter_ch_54/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f75ffbb5-523b-4af9-8ed9-8b68f0a9e321/chapter_ch_54/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f75ffbb5-523b-4af9-8ed9-8b68f0a9e321/chapter_ch_54/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f75ffbb5-523b-4af9-8ed9-8b68f0a9e321/chapter_ch_54/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f75ffbb5-523b-4af9-8ed9-8b68f0a9e321/chapter_ch_54/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f75ffbb5-523b-4af9-8ed9-8b68f0a9e321/chapter_ch_54/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f75ffbb5-523b-4af9-8ed9-8b68f0a9e321/chapter_ch_54/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"3a16b888-9e6f-4378-bddb-60832525255d","number":"53","chapter":"53","title":"","date":"2026-07-17","released":"2026-07-17","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f75ffbb5-523b-4af9-8ed9-8b68f0a9e321/chapter_ch_53/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f75ffbb5-523b-4af9-8ed9-